  # is the cold one, because the drift nudge only fires when elapsed EXCEEDS
  # budget — so budgeting the worst case never trips it spuriously, while
  # budgeting the warm case would redden the gate on every fresh checkout and
  # after every TLC upgrade. That is the flaky-gate failure this header warns
